WEBVTT

00:04:57.125 --> 00:05:02.809
Most of our major movements
in this country might have been delayed

00:05:02.833 --> 00:05:04.726
or even dead

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:09.042
if it weren't for the presence
of unlikely allies.

00:05:10.083 --> 00:05:12.351
When the same people speak up

00:05:12.375 --> 00:05:15.601
in the same ways they've always spoken up,

00:05:15.625 --> 00:05:18.434
the most we'll ever get
are the same results

00:05:18.458 --> 00:05:21.042
over and over again.

00:05:21.833 --> 00:05:24.601
You know, allies often
stand on the sidelines

00:05:24.625 --> 00:05:27.101
waiting to be called up.

00:05:27.125 --> 00:05:32.018
But what if unlikely allies
led out in front of issues?